  "description": "Do-Won, who has unwittingly become entangled in the promiscuous one-night-stand lifestyle of his next-door neighbor, Lee Rok, is exhausted and tormented by the noise he hears every night. Although he has complained about the noise, which has gotten worse lately, Lee Rok simply brushes it off, and the situation remains unresolved. Eventually, Do-Won begins to feel a sense of crisis after even dreaming about Lee Rok. Just as Do-Won, no longer wanting to be entangled in Lee Rok’s complicated one-night stands, resolves to keep his distance, his plan hits a snag when Lee Rok, drunk, mistakes him for a one-night stand partner.\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
